    {
      "id": "heldout-partial-invoice-redesign:seg:0",
      "text": "Customers keep saying our invoices look like a receipt from 2005."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-partial-invoice-redesign:seg:1",
      "text": "Fair. The template hasn't changed since we launched."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-partial-invoice-redesign:seg:2",
      "text": "The new design is approved. Logo, line items grouped by project, a clear due date."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-partial-invoice-redesign:seg:3",
      "text": "Then let's get the invoice redesign live on Monday the 16th. Noah owns it."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-partial-invoice-redesign:seg:4",
      "text": "The 16th is fine."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-partial-invoice-redesign:seg:5",
      "text": "I'll send Noah the final assets tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-partial-invoice-redesign:seg:6",
      "text": "And we should warn the accounting firms that parse our PDFs."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-partial-invoice-redesign:seg:7",
      "text": "I'll email the three firms on the integration list this week."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-partial-invoice-redesign:seg:8",
      "text": "Thanks. Do we keep the old layout available as an option?"
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-partial-invoice-redesign:seg:9",
      "text": "No. One layout."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-partial-invoice-redesign:seg:10",
      "text": "Agreed."
    }
  ],
